swaylock-plugin (1.8.7.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New --pause-when-hidden / --pause-when-hidden-delay: SIGSTOP the background
    program's process group while none of its outputs are being drawn, using
    stalled frame callbacks as the signal. Off by default.

